 "question": "The stored values of Site Styles' Fonts, Buttons and Forms views, for oracle-readback.mjs.",
 "how": "Blocks Probe, Site Styles opened by name, each view and the views one row under it read twice. Save off at every read, no question on Exit. Each entry is label, words, input value, state, swatch. No pick, slider, pack, Reset or row change.",
 "anchor": "Stored after the probes. The values with an older read are checked against it by scripts/check-readback.mjs: every button type against CAP-BUTTONROWS, Forms and Form Spacing against CAP-FORMROWS, Headings, Paragraphs and Spacing against CAP-SITESTYLEROWS. The rest is only as old as this list.",
 "notRead": ["Forms > Effects holds tile names only: which tile is on shows by a mark, not read here.", "Forms > Colors holds the theme the walk read last, Darkest 2.", "Rows under these views: a font's family, Style, Weight, a Shape's list, Checkbox, Radio and Survey.", "Assign Styles and the Themes row."],
